Spec: Onboarding

Purpose:
  First run: name, optional profile photo, default activity.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  /test/onboarding

References:
  /docs/specs/history/09-onboarding.md
  /lib/features/profile/profile.sdd

Must:
  The flow is name, photo, activity, then the main shell.
  Let's go and Skip both continue; a name is saved only when non-blank, trimmed, at most `30` characters.
  The photo step never finishes onboarding.
  Continue on the activity step saves the activity as the last activity type and marks onboarding done.
  Longboard is preselected.
